#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""folk — discover unwritten calling protocols and their breaches.

A folk protocol is a pair of calls that the codebase treats as a unit
(lock then unlock, begin_tx then commit_tx) without ever writing that
rule down. folk mines those pairs from path-sensitive call sequences
and reports the sites that perform only one half.
"""

